<title>BELGIUM: Belgian bond exchange auction totals 20 mln bfr.</title>
<headline>Belgian bond exchange auction totals 20 mln bfr.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1996-12-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Belgian Treasury's bond exchange auction totalled 20 million francs, the Treasury said in a statement  BELE.</p>
<p>At the auction, participants could exchange the OLO expiring in May 1997 against OLOs expiring in April 1999, December 2000, June 2002, October 2004 and May 2006. The only offers made were for the December 2000 OLO.</p>
<p>-- Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6810</p>
</text>
